    Bug 1945645 - Fix intermittent comm/mail/test/browser/message-header/browser_returnReceipt.js ... Component returned failure code: 0x80004004 (NS_ERROR_ABORT) [nsIWindowWatcher.openWindow]. r=john.bieling


    This is actually "bleading over" from the previous test which is browser_replyToListFromAddressSelection.js which
    was not completely done when we force-closed the window. The prompt couldn't proceed with what it was doing as the browsing context went away...

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D250751

